    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p>Last updated: [Insert Date]</p>

    <p><strong>The Phantom Handbook</strong> ("we", "our", or "the App") is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we handle information when you use our mobile application.</p>

    <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
    <p><strong>Personal Data:</strong> We do not collect, request, or store any personally identifiable information (PII) such as your name, email address, phone number, or location.</p>
    <p><strong>Local Data:</strong> The App saves certain information locally on your device to improve your experience, including:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Bookmarks (Topics you have saved).</li>
        <li>Reading Progress (Sections you have completed).</li>
        <li>View Statistics (Frequency of topics viewed).</li>
    </ul>
    <p>This data is stored strictly on your device and is never transmitted to our servers or any third parties.</p>

    <h2>2. Permissions</h2>
    <p>The App does not require any special permissions (such as access to your camera, contacts, or internet) to function. It operates entirely offline.</p>

    <h2>3. Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>We do not use third-party analytics, advertising networks, or social media integrations that track your behavior or collect your data.</p>

    <h2>4. Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p>Our App does not collect any information from children. Since no personal data is collected, it is safe for use by individuals of all ages.</p>

    <h2>5. Data Retention and Deletion</h2>
    <p>All data generated by the App stays on your device. You can delete this data at any time by clearing the App's cache/data in your device settings or by uninstalling the App.</p>

    <h2>6. Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>We may update our Privacy Policy from time to time. Any changes will be reflected by updating the "Last updated" date at the top of this page.</p>

    <h2>7. Contact Us</h2>
    <p>If you have any questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at: <strong>[Insert Your Email Address]</strong></p>

